From e1805275c141cee8f5793b709aa73695f22bd83f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 07:54:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ci: switch CI build+deploy trigger from dev/main to custom

Patch-based branch model migration: custom is now the single integration
branch carrying the 52-patch stack; dev/main is retired (kept as archive).
---
 .github/workflows/build.yml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/build.yml b/.github/workflows/build.yml
index cfcfb310e..db893f1be 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/build.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/build.yml
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@ on:
   push:
     branches:
       - main
+      - custom-next
   pull_request:
     branches:
       - main
-- 
2.53.0

